{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>本年度《2026香港小姐競選》今日（2日）在電視城舉行首輪面試，有份獲邀參加首輪面試的參選佳麗於早上到達電視城，準備下午見無綫高層進行面試。當中不乏學歷高、多才多藝的高質美女。</p><p>攝：葉志明、陳順禎、林迅景、陳釗</p><figure><img alt=\"25歲的林穎彤為鋼琴老師。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138459605073006592123056.jpeg/7U75G2hVBbdcgwsBokxlahqlcg6k9GGa41YABdlWAAU\"/><figcaption>25歲的林穎彤為鋼琴老師。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林穎彤樣子甜美斯文。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138459602623401984941836.jpeg/J_ehxav42ESSlyWg8wAWzR-HJDJURPoc5xbHkN0Wx5A\"/><figcaption>林穎彤樣子甜美斯文。</figcaption></figure><p>林穎彤自爆曾是TVB童星</p><p>現年25歲的鋼琴老師林穎彤（Winnie）不僅擁有港大碩士學歷，更自揭曾經是TVB童星，參演過兩部經典劇集，包括《缺宅男女》及《衝上雲霄》，即時引起關注。Winnie透露自己擁有香港大學應用語言系碩士學位，擅長跳芭蕾舞，同時十分喜愛小動物。過去亦參選過《第35屆亞洲小姐競選全球大賽香港賽區》累積選美經驗，相信擁有豐富的舞台經驗或成為她一大優勢。</p><figure><img alt=\"林穎彤擁有港大碩士學歷。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138460317110636544185709.jpeg/IqfULwLyZ2Fkx2rlK8sSjR80OHqpoma4Vq6hA1auoQM\"/><figcaption>林穎彤擁有港大碩士學歷。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林穎彤自揭曾經是TVB童星，參演過兩部經典劇集，包括《缺宅男女》及《衝上雲霄》。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138460313885085696510623.jpeg/bWYqrLVP2C5Po0HcO75FyHyOLu48gEUyA8DU7APA1Ow\"/><figcaption>林穎彤自揭曾經是TVB童星，參演過兩部經典劇集，包括《缺宅男女》及《衝上雲霄》。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林穎彤甜美可愛。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138460088709943296674385.png/igB_DR87UzQI6DB8sQ6joIAnzwNK9XXPTiWhqU4loak\"/><figcaption>林穎彤甜美可愛。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"熱愛跳舞。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138460086222589952849635.png/-5bwEdvzV3jT77Vw2O8cdjgf6YTI3mqCZosGu2aLBrs\"/><figcaption>熱愛跳舞。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擅長跳芭蕾舞。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138460082674077696278430.png/wTH5uCOIHuC6kiKY9GoWpO7oKzV6UV_SrPkH4Kz5B-A\"/><figcaption>擅長跳芭蕾舞。（IG/@winnie.wingtung）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T04:59:54.794927+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":499,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}